// rts/data/scripts/ui_tech.json: the player-interface tech script (rts/docs/specs/player_interface.md section 2). Parsed by Rts.Sim.Data.CommandScript in the Unity SimulationHost (set its "Script Relative Path" to scripts/ui_tech.json) and the headless harness (--script rts/data/scripts/ui_tech.json). ui_sandbox.json plus complete tech structures and casters beside each HQ at tick 0 (script spawns skip costs, requirements and construction): Skai gets a Windspire, a Storm Spire and two Stormcallers; Water gets a Shell Forge, a Reef Workshop and two Tidecallers; and two Skai Windrunners owned by Water stand near the Skai base as grounding targets (spawn_unit does not check factions). Used by the train, research and ability checks (UI-2, research panel, UI-5). Slot 0 is Skai, slot 1 is Water; set LocalCommands' "Local Player Slot" to 1 to play Water.
